## Dry run first

AWS_PROFILE=saml rosa create cluster ... --dry-run -y

INFO: Creating cluster 'alebedev-test'
INFO: Creating cluster 'alebedev-test' should succeed. Run without the '--dry-run' flag to create the cluster.
