## State progression
#
# 'waiting (Waiting for user action)' right after create is NORMAL and does
# not mean anything is actually required of you -- it clears on its own once
# OCM verifies the OIDC provider and the 8 operator roles. ~1 min later it
# moved to 'validating'.
#
#   waiting -> validating -> installing -> ready

## Monitoring

AWS_PROFILE=saml rosa describe cluster -c alebedev-test
AWS_PROFILE=saml rosa logs install -c alebedev-test --watch

